<title>USA: Greif Bros Corp sets qtly div $0.12.</title>
<headline>Greif Bros Corp sets qtly div $0.12.</headline>
<dateline>DELAWARE, Ohio 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greif Bros Corp said it declared a quarterly dividend of $0.12 per share for its class A common and a quarterly dividend of $0.18 per share for its class B common.</p>
<p>Both dividends are payable April 1 to shareholders of record on March 20.</p>
<p>The prior class A dividend was $0.10 per share and the prior class B dividend was $0.14 per share.</p>
<p>The company was not available to comment about the increase in the dividends.</p>
</text>
